      "message": "[error] Line 1095: 🔴 `attachExternalHostAudio` rejects when `hostAudioInputs_` is non-empty, but `detachHost()`/`unbindHostAudio()` never clear `hostAudioInputs_`. After any prior native host attach/detach, this stale map makes external-host attach fail permanently in the same conference even when state is `ACTIVE_DETACHED`. This breaks valid host handoff flows. Fix by clearing `hostAudioInputs_` on detach (or stop using map emptiness as a precondition) and key eligibility off actual conference state/active bindings instead.",
