      "message": "[warning] Line 297: 🟡 ICE gathering currently accepts only a HOST+UDP local candidate to build the SDP answer address, and fails otherwise (`ICE gathering produced no usable RTP candidate`). This can reject valid TURN/relay-only or host-suppressed environments even when ICE gathering succeeded. Use the first valid UDP candidate regardless of candidate type (HOST/SRFLX/RELAY), or derive the published address from ICE local attributes rather than hard-requiring `PJ_ICE_CAND_TYPE_HOST`.",
